Ladybird includes relative-position offsets in its recorded anchor
rectangles. Blink’s FragmentBuilder::PropagateFromFragment adds the
relative offset when propagating anchors. Gecko maps each frame’s
rectangle in AnchorPositioningUtils::GetCombinedFragmentRects, via
GetOffsetToIgnoringScrollingAndSticky. WebKit maps the border box
with localToContainerQuad in its boxBoundingBoxInContainer, inside
AnchorPositionEvaluator.cpp. All three include relative positioning.
